{
  "_help": "Logbook pathways for the Wavelength app (/app/). Scan types define the findings form. Pathways group scan types into modules with targets. Match keys: 'f.<field>' reads a finding, other keys read the entry (overall, setting, supervision). Check targets against each body's current curriculum pack and update 'checked' when you do.",
